---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Infant Care Program - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover Marietta Childcare's Infant Care Program for newborns to 12 months with personalized care, developmental support, and safe environment.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/infant_tummy_time_teacher_hand_background.jpg" 
        alt="Infant care" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Infant Care Program</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Personalized, nurturing care for newborns through 12 months with developmental support and secure attachments.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Infant Care Program provides personalized, nurturing care for newborns through 12 months. The Infant Care Program at Marietta Childcare focuses on building secure attachments, supporting developmental milestones, and creating a safe environment for your youngest learners.
        </p>

        <h2>Program Overview</h2>
        <p>
          The Infant Care Program serves infants from birth to 12 months with individualized attention and developmental support. Marietta Childcare's infant caregivers understand that each infant develops at their own pace and provide responsive, attentive care tailored to individual needs.
        </p>

        <h2>Developmental Milestones</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's educators track developmental milestones including motor skills, cognitive development, and social-emotional growth. The Infant Care Program supports milestone achievement through age-appropriate activities, tummy time, sensory exploration, and responsive interactions.
        </p>

        <h2>Daily Routines</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare maintains consistent daily routines that support infant development and comfort. The Infant Care Program includes scheduled feeding times, nap periods, diaper changes, and play activities designed to support growth and learning.
        </p>

        <h2>Safety Protocols</h2>
        <p>
          Safety is paramount in Marietta Childcare's Infant Care Program. Marietta Childcare follows safe sleep guidelines, maintains sanitized environments, uses secure equipment, and implements strict health and safety protocols to protect infant wellbeing.
        </p>

        <h2>Parent Communication</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare provides daily updates about your infant's activities, feeding, sleep, and development. The Infant Care Program includes regular parent-teacher conferences and open communication to ensure parents stay informed about their child's progress.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">What We Provide</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Personalized care plans</li>
            <li>✓ Secure attachment building</li>
            <li>✓ Developmental tracking</li>
            <li>✓ Safe sleep environment</li>
            <li>✓ Sensory activities</li>
            <li>✓ Daily parent updates</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Age Range & Ratios</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Birth to 12 months</li>
            <li>✓ Low caregiver-to-infant ratios</li>
            <li>✓ Consistent primary caregiver</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible scheduling available</li>
            <li>✓ Full-time and part-time options</li>
            <li>✓ Extended hours available</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Infant Care at Marietta Childcare</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare understands the importance of quality infant care during these critical early months. The Infant Care Program creates a nurturing, responsive environment where your baby can grow, learn, and develop secure attachments.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Schedule a Tour
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs/toddler-program" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Toddler Program (12-36 months) →</a>
          <a href="/resources/child-development" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Child Development Guide →</a>
          <a href="/faq/enrollment-process" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Enrollment Process →</a>
          <a href="/programs" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">All Programs →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
